cst-title = Same agent, any body.
cst-lede = Nestor is the star at the centre: one agent, one memory. Every device you add becomes a satellite, in any room, and the same conversation carries on from one to the next.
cst-hint = Add a device to the house: Nestor pairs with it and the conversation carries on there.
cst-label = Your house as a constellation
cst-thread = The same conversation
