cst-speaker-ask = Add flour and apples to the list.
cst-speaker-say = Added. And no peanuts in the snack ideas, for Jules.
cst-tablet-who = Léa
cst-tablet-ask = What’s left on the list?
cst-tablet-say = Flour and apples. Mathis added them this morning.
cst-reachy-who = Jules
cst-reachy-ask = Is the crumble ready?
